 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – Daily and Monthly Closing (2BK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Daily and Monthly Closing allows you to prepare and carry out the activities required for day-end and month-end closing for Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC). The major activity for closing is the reconciliation between Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable and General Ledger (FI-GL). In addition, you can write off uncollectible receivables in Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Close reconciliation keys</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Close an accounting period</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer FI-CA total records to the General Ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check the reconciliation between open items and the General Ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Write off open receivables and credits of a business partner</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display write-off history</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Doubtful receivable</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Foreign currency valuation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform simple write-off process using reason codes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure consistency between Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable and G/L during closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Guarantee audit-proof data with reconciliation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 - 每日和每月关账 (2BK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">每日和每月结算允许您为集中合同会计 (FI-CAC) 准备和执行日终和月末结算所需的活动。关账的主要活动是合同科目应收和应付账款与总账 (FI-GL) 之间的对账。此外，您可以在集中合同会计 (FI-CAC) 中注销无法收回的应收账款。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">关闭对账码</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">关闭会计期间</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将 FI-CA 总记录传输到总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查未清项和总账之间的对账。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">注销业务伙伴的未清应收账款和贷项。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示注销历史记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">坏账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">外币评估</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa9ccf2321ae342069839ffff3c724c47__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用原因代码执行简单的注销流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在关账期间，确保合同科目应收和应付账款与总账之间的一致性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过对账保证审计证明数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
